{"event": "start", "id": "24215-1795750418018225261", "target": "practice", "sql": "-- apply clear_trial.py\ndef run(G):\n    trial = [n for n, d in G.nodes(data=True) if d.get(\"kind\") == \"sailing\" and str(n).startswith(\"TRIAL-\")]\n    G.remove_nodes_from(trial)\n    return len(trial)\n"}
